WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.607
These are the vendor facts
the chapter's code relies on,

2
00:00:03.607 --> 00:00:05.425
each read on November first.

3
00:00:05.425 --> 00:00:09.200
A scripted REST API has a fixed URL shape.

4
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.026
Access is set by API access
policies and endpoint ACLs,

5
00:00:13.026 --> 00:00:18.212
and creating one needs the web service
admin role, which calling it doesn't.

6
00:00:18.212 --> 00:00:22.150
The kit uses two SailPoint
triggers, both fire-and-forget.

7
00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:25.800
ServiceNow's Government
Community Cloud is FedRAMP High;

8
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:29.450
SailPoint's Identity Security
Cloud is FedRAMP Moderate.

9
00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:33.550
And a free developer instance is
reclaimed after ten days unused.
